  "description": "Fast, zero-allocation postal code lookup for .NET 8+. Built-in data for US (41k zip codes), Canada (891k postal codes) and Mexico (32k postal codes). Lookup by zip/postal code, city, state, province and IANA timezone. FrozenDictionary-backed for low-allocation hot paths. Extensible via ICodeDataSource. For .NET Standard 2.0 / .NET Framework support use the ZipPostLookup.Legacy package.",
